mcp = "tests/repair_22_31_539.rs: persisted_mcp_receipt_ranks_normalize_after_restart compiles the identical private production codec in src/session_control/mcp_record.rs, exercises its event/record writer, durable store/index, reopen and public evidence consumer at ranks 6, 4, 5 and 3, with Corrupt for 2, 0, 7 and 255 from the same decoder and the durable index admission before those invalid bytes reach disk. The receipt bytes come from the node producer's checked-in conformance vectors. This private-codec regression executes in the declared integration gate; production uses the same append_event and encode methods."
